00:19:29,881 --> 00:19:33,880
The job will take an entire week to complete.

250
00:19:33,881 --> 00:19:40,880
As they package the giant crane, their work has been made more manageable by its ingenious design.

251
00:19:40,881 --> 00:19:47,880
Many of its individual parts do double duty, acting as containers for other pieces.

252
00:19:47,881 --> 00:19:53,260
When the crane is in action, steel panels like this one function as counterweights for

253
00:19:53,261 --> 00:20:01,040
