256
00:20:10,721 --> 00:20:16,160
Many of the reconfigured packaged sections are either 20 or 40 feet long.

257
00:20:16,161 --> 00:20:20,960
exact dimensions of shipping containers that fit on commercial cargo vessels and tractor-trailer

258
00:20:20,961 --> 00:20:25,395
rigs. This makes transporting the sections easier.

