00:21:46,080 --> 00:21:48,220
You can pick up a lot more weight with it versus one of

279
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:50,720
the other trucks. The way this one's set up is about 360

280
00:21:50,820 --> 00:21:56,340
metric tons. This is around about 32 tons per axle.

