00:22:01,940 --> 00:22:04,640
But manpower is no less critical.

284
00:22:04,740 --> 00:22:07,580
All the technological advances we've made over the years in

285
00:22:07,581 --> 00:22:12,060
in building stronger machines and more advanced equipment,

286
00:22:12,061 --> 00:22:13,980
it still boils down to the men and women

287
00:22:13,981 --> 00:22:15,360
