00:22:23,921 --> 00:22:27,640
literally takes an army to get the job done.

290
00:22:27,641 --> 00:22:32,200
In fact, it takes an army, Navy, Marine Corps, and Air Force.

291
00:22:32,201 --> 00:22:35,680
Meet the men and women of the U.S. Transportation Command,

292
00:22:35,681 --> 00:22:38,220
US Transcom for short.

293
00:22:38,221 --> 00:22:42,020
Their gargantuan task is to pack and ship every single item

294
00:22:42,021 --> 00:22:46,560
