295
00:22:46,561 --> 00:22:49,720
US Transcom is really responsible overall

296
00:22:49,721 --> 00:22:53,000
for the strategic movement of our military forces

297
00:22:53,001 --> 00:22:53,840
around the world.

298
00:22:53,841 --> 00:22:56,500
We basically do about 900 sorties a day,

299
00:22:56,501 --> 00:22:58,780
2,600 truck movements.

300
00:22:58,781 --> 00:23:02,440
We have 44 ships that are onloading, offloading,

301
00:23:02,441 --> 00:23:05,180
or underway, and about 100 real car

302
00:23:05,181 --> 00:23:06,368
shipments every day.

303
00:23:06,369 --> 00:23:11,300
If we actually went to full-out war, we'd do about three to four times that amount.

304
00:23:12,300 --> 00:23:16,400
U.S. Transcom headquarters is located at Scott Air Force Base in Illinois.

305
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:25,440
Here, 1,400 military and civilian personnel supervise the efforts of 145,000 workers worldwide.

306
00:23:26,800 --> 00:23:31,620
We have some folks who are planning missions for the air crews, filing flight plans,

307
00:23:31,621 --> 00:23:33,960
checking weather, notices to airmen.

308
00:23:33,961 --> 00:23:35,700
We have other personnel in here who are actually

309
00:23:35,701 --> 00:23:38,260
monitoring the missions, looking for problems,

310
00:23:38,261 --> 00:23:41,800
looking for choke points, solving crises before they happen.

311
00:23:41,801 --> 00:23:43,140
This isn't rocket science.

312
00:23:43,141 --> 00:23:44,500
It's harder.

313
00:23:44,501 --> 00:23:49,800
US Transcom manages more than 100,000 flights each year.

314
00:23:49,801 --> 00:23:54,980
Many originate here at Dover Air Force Base in Delaware.

315
00:23:54,981 --> 00:24:00,140
Huge C-5 and C-17 cargo planes function as aerial moving vans

316
00:24:00,141 --> 00:24:05,020
for all manner of weapons, vehicles, equipment, and supplies.

317
00:24:05,021 --> 00:24:07,420
Our mission here at Dover Air Force Base is to deliver.

318
00:24:07,421 --> 00:24:12,060
Dover Air Force Base supplies approximately 75% of all cargo

319
00:24:12,061 --> 00:24:14,780
through the air transit, the strategic airlift system.

320
00:24:14,781 --> 00:24:16,980
We're the guys loading the aircraft,

321
00:24:16,981 --> 00:24:18,860
aggregating the cargo onto the pallets

322
00:24:18,861 --> 00:24:21,020
