323
00:24:21,021 --> 00:24:23,000
Every day, hundreds of cargo pallets

324
00:24:23,001 --> 00:24:26,000
arrive at Dover from shippers.

325
00:24:26,001 --> 00:24:28,300
Each needs to be inspected, weighed, and packaged

326
00:24:28,301 --> 00:24:31,800
